WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.916
Welcome to Digital Literacy for Teachers. Organised files save you hours.

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:10.255
Create one main folder, with folders inside for each class or subject.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.426
Give files clear names that say what, and when.

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.931
Share worksheets as PDF, so they look the same on every device.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.673
And keep a second copy of important files. Phones get lost.

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:34.433
Before you move on, check: Create folders for each class. Rename five files clearly. Back up your important files. Share one file as a PDF.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.388
In the next lesson: Finding good resources.
